ilityExpression": "not isSelectAll", "frontComponentUniversalIdentifier": "1061d505-6748-48c1-96e9-5dbf6fef6561", "availabilityObjectUniversalIdentifier": "20202020-b374-4779-a561-80086cb2e17f"}], "pageLayoutWidgets": [], "connectionProviders": [], "navigationMenuItems": [], "timelineActivityTypes": []}	t	f	public/people-data-labs-icon.png	Enrich People and Companies with People Data Labs data.	Twenty	Enrichment	\N	# People Data Labs\n\n**Turn a name into a full profile — enrich any Person or Company in one click.**\n\n## ✨ What you get\n\n- **+30 rich data fields** per Person and Company — seniority, skills, firmographics, funding, socials & more\n- **Run it anywhere** — from the command menu, as a workflow step, or straight from AI chat\n- **Smart matching** — finds the right profile from a LinkedIn, email, or domain, and only writes confident matches. Set the minimum likelihood in the app settings to adapt matching to your needs\n\n## 💳 Billing\n\nPay only for matches, in Twenty credits — **not found and skipped records are free.**\n\n- **Person match:** $0.15\n- **Company match:** $0.075\n	\N	\N	\N	{}	[{"path": "public/gallery/cover.png", "fileId": "30a4a5ac-3ab5-4590-a0a6-7d452cd11d95"}]	19040025-e409-4baf-b0a9-7f57bfdf50bb	$0.15 per person match and $0.075 per company match. Not found and skipped records are free. Billed to your Twenty credits.
