": "Page IDs", "isNullable": true, "description": "JSON array of Facebook page IDs", "defaultValue": null, "universalIdentifier": "d45cfab1-f22b-4d82-964d-3c21fe71219c"}, {"icon": "IconCircleDot", "name": "status", "type": "SELECT", "label": "Status", "options": [{"id": "50dd1e87-c926-526c-a94e-cd2bdf13d024", "color": "green", "label": "Connected", "value": "CONNECTED", "position": 0}, {"id": "3224b561-61d6-5ad9-97a8-5f1e23a0a9d7", "color": "yellow", "label": "Pending", "value": "PENDING", "position": 1}, {"id": "3cbcce37-8550-5eec-ac51-0be797ba21d3", "color": "red", "label": "Disconnected", "value": "DISCONNECTED", "position": 2}], "description": "Connection status", "defaultValue": "'PENDING'", "universalIdentifier": "5fc760c3-cf97-41e9-b42b-0530084d1cb4"}], "namePlural": "whatsappConnections", "description": "A connected WhatsApp Business Account (WABA)", "labelPlural": "WhatsApp Connections", "nameSingular": "whatsappConnection", "labelSingular": "WhatsApp Connection", "universalIdentifier": "0f9f83c6-3493-4156-a704-6fce0dd5d9b3", "labelIdentifierFieldMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "1ec00c93-58a6-4ec5-b620-c7ef52453e98"}], "viewFields": [], "application": {"logo": "public/logo.png", "author": "9dots", "category": "Sales", "description": "Connect WhatsApp Business accounts to Twenty CRM via Meta embedded signup", "displayName": "WhatsApp Business", "emailSupport": "hello@9dots.co", "galleryImages": ["public/Timeline.png", "public/people_list.png", "public/dashboard.png"], "aboutDescription": "## 💬 Business Whatsapp integration for Twenty\\n\\n- **It automatically creates a Person record** when you message a customer on WhatsApp, or they message you.\\n\\n- **Connect as many numbers** as you like. Every number connects with the same workspace.\\n\\n- **Keep your accounts safe** with the official Whatsapp integration: this application uses **official Whatsapp integration**.\\n\\n- **It uses Coexistence**: you can continue talking to customers on your phone or Whatsapp Web, and add programmatic responses via API - both work side by side. \\n\\n---\\n\\n## ✨ Need something more advanced?\\nThis basic Whatsapp integration helps you get initial visibility on the customers messaging your business on Whatsapp. It makes way for more advanced implementations, such as:\\n- Reply to customers programmatically via API, without losing the messaging via mobile or web Whatsapp. \\n- Update Opportunities or other objects automatically based on Whatsapp chats. Examples: create and update Opportunity when a new lead comes in; change Stage when deal is closed; eslacalte based on the contents of the chat.\\n- Layer in AI-powered conversations to handle routine replies\\n- Run sentiment analysis on your interactions: what customers are asking, where they churn.\\n- Surface lead-acquisition analytics: channels, conversion and more.\\n\\nWe specialise in these integrations and happy to help.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📱 Requirements\\n\\n1. The integration requires a registered Business Whatsapp number.\\n2. The integration requires you to have a Business Portfolio in Meta. You can create one when onboarding, or reuse existing if you have one.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔌 How to connect Whatsapp after you installed the app\\n- Create a **workspace API key** and add it in this application -> Settings tab under `WORKSPACE_API_KEY`\\n- Click \\"Connect WA\\" - it's pinned on the top right of your workspace\\n- In the side bar, enter the phone number you're connecting\\n- Click \\"Connect\\" and complete Meta signup in a pop-up window\\n\\n---\\nFor any enquiries, please contact us at hello@9dots.co\\n\\n", "yarnLockChecksum": "1b00796e4cc08693caed5f11509a1f9f", "packageJsonChecksum": "ed8054a1522f193e987eaa3459c75de3", "universalIdentifier": "701b1254-c526-4b63-8e30-ca4e62c20645", "applicationVariables": {"WORKSPACE_API_KEY": {"value": "", "isSecret": true, "description": "Twenty workspace API key — saved to Supabase after each onboarding so the backend can call the CRM", "universalIdentifier": "d3a1b2c4-8e5f-4a9b-b1c2-3d4e5f6a7b8c"}}, "requiredServerVersionRange": ">=2.40.0", "defaultRoleUniversalIdentifier": "dd84a55b-ab59-4b14-9125-2ba8a01879f7"}, "pageLayouts": [{"name": "WhatsApp Business", "tabs": [{"icon": "IconBrandWhatsapp", "title": "Connect", "widgets": [{"type": "FRONT_COMPONENT", "title": "WhatsApp Connect", "position": {"layoutMode": "CANVAS"}, "configuration": {"configurationType": "FRONT_COMPONENT", "frontComponentUniversalIdentifier": "f4f1daaf-94f5-4dac-bc41-3ea3c63bb42b"}, "universalIdentifier": "39587fb8-fe78-43a5-a9ae-51498a7b149c"}], "position": 0, "layoutMode": "CANVAS", "universalIdentifier": "9f6bf511-e333-433f-92c9-dbaf92afc354"}], "type": "STANDALONE_PAGE", "universalIdentifier": "99bf6ead-4429-4239-8696-3286515dc0c1"}], "publicAssets": [{"checksum": "278d001c4999cbb2bc980e670eae9de3", "fileName": "dashboard.png", "filePath": "public/dashboard.png", "fileType": "png"}, {"checksum": "84a2338ea78e4efbbf18fb1b785d6585", "fileName": "logo.png", "filePath": "public/logo.png", "fileType": "png"}, {"checksum": "0ce6415a3c1d3407fcca6752491d6da7", "fileName": "people_list.png", "filePath": "public/people_list.png", "fileType": "png"}, {"checksum": "5fab64579e5d7d68afe50556b735cc06", "fileName": "Timeline.png", "filePath": "public/Timeline.png", "fileType": "png"}], "logicFunctions": [{"name": "save-whatsapp-connection", "handlerName": "default.config.handler", "timeoutSeconds": 10, "builtHandlerPath": "src/logic/save-connection.mjs", "sourceHandlerPath": "src/logic/save-connection.ts", "universalIdentifier": "62e930f6-f439-4f1d-812a-4909e9a5b568", "builtHandlerChecksum": "f8fda17d0c95ac53613685ea78c6dd74", "httpRouteTriggerSettings": {"path": "/whatsapp/save-connection", "httpMethod": "POST", "isAuthRequired": false}}, {"name": "get-whatsapp-config", "handlerName": "default.config.handler", "timeoutSeconds": 5, "builtHandlerPath": "src/logic/get-config.mjs", "sourceHandlerPath": "src/logic/get-config.ts", "universalIdentifier": "a0427cbf-2ede-4123-929b-a3e0064c4387", "builtHandlerChecksum": "87c8d490bd6fd43c05844950d6403e4f", "httpRouteTriggerSettings": {"path": "/whatsapp/config", "httpMethod": "GET", "isAuthRequired": true}}], "pageLayoutTabs": [], "frontComponents": [{"name": "whatsapp-connect", "isHeadless": false, "description": "WhatsApp Business Account connection management panel", "componentName": "WhatsAppConnectComponent", "usesSdkClient": false, "builtComponentPath": "src/front-components/whatsapp-connect.mjs", "sourceComponentPath": "src/front-components/whatsapp-connect.tsx", "universalIdentifier": "f4f1daaf-94f5-4dac-bc41-3ea3c63bb42b", "builtComponentChecksum": "871b529f227c593a70c9bb39813c9b06ec53bd592d9d1eef7de1a406aee9d833"}], "permissionFlags": [], "commandMenuItems": [{"label": "Connect WhatsApp Business", "isPinned": true, "shortLabel": "Connect WA", "availabilityType": "GLOBAL", "universalIdentifier": "1e53042c-1b10-4819-ba89-fbfe8dbb0ef6", "frontComponentUniversalIdentifier": "f4f1daaf-94f5-4dac-bc41-3ea3c63bb42b"}], "pageLayoutWidgets": [], "connectionProviders": [], "navigationMenuItems": [{"icon": "IconAddressBook", "name": "WhatsApp Connections", "type": "OBJECT", "color": "green", "position": 31, "universalIdentifier": "e2d5c8b0-4a7f-4e9d-8b3a-1c6f2e4d8a9b", "targetObjectUniversalIdentifier": "0f9f83c6-3493-4156-a704-6fce0dd5d9b3"}], "timelineActivityTypes": []}	f	f	public/logo.png	Connect WhatsApp Business accounts to Twenty CRM via Meta embedded signup	9dots	Sales	\N	## 💬 Business Whatsapp integration for Twenty\n\n- **It automatically creates a Person record** when you message a customer on WhatsApp, or they message you.\n\n- **Connect as many numbers** as you like. Every number connects with the same workspace.\n\n- **Keep your accounts safe** with the official Whatsapp integration: this application uses **official Whatsapp integration**.\n\n- **It uses Coexistence**: you can continue talking to customers on your phone or Whatsapp Web, and add programmatic responses via API - both work side by side. \n\n---\n\n## ✨ Need something more advanced?\nThis basic Whatsapp integration helps you get initial visibility on the customers messaging your business on Whatsapp. It makes way for more advanced implementations, such as:\n- Reply to customers programmatically via API, without losing the messaging via mobile or web Whatsapp. \n- Update Opportunities or other objects automatically based on Whatsapp chats. Examples: create and update Opportunity when a new lead comes in; change Stage when deal is closed; eslacalte based on the contents of the chat.\n- Layer in AI-powered conversations to handle routine replies\n- Run sentiment analysis on your interactions: what customers are asking, where they churn.\n- Surface lead-acquisition analytics: channels, conversion and more.\n\nWe specialise in these integrations and happy to help.\n\n---\n\n## 📱 Requirements\n\n1. The integration requires a registered Business Whatsapp number.\n2. The integration requires you to have a Business Portfolio in Meta. You can create one when onboarding, or reuse existing if you have one.\n\n---\n\n## 🔌 How to connect Whatsapp after you installed the app\n- Create a **workspace API key** and add it in this application -> Settings tab under `WORKSPACE_API_KEY`\n- Click "Connect WA" - it's pinned on the top right of your workspace\n- In the side bar, enter the phone number you're connecting\n- Click "Connect" and complete Meta signup in a pop-up window\n\n---\nFor any enquiries, please contact us at hello@9dots.co\n\n	\N	hello@9dots.co	\N	{}	[{"path": "public/Timeline.png", "fileId": "93d08489-99cd-4f96-9862-4ee6f0955c8d"}, {"path": "public/people_list.png", "fileId": "4eb8e157-60c6-448f-977a-077b73b43df6"}, {"path": "public/dashboard.png", "fileId": "6c8d3b5f-f383-4aaf-a320-8272499f7e1d"}]	787cb523-aebf-4965-af88-f8c9aa454f67	\N
