iption": "Note title (e.g. the first characters of the content).", "universalIdentifier": "e9188436-664f-4862-aced-4e747f3aee31"}, {"icon": "IconCalendarTime", "name": "noteCreatedAt", "type": "DATE_TIME", "label": "Created at", "isNullable": true, "description": "When the note was created on Talqui, during the service session. Differs from Twenty's automatic createdAt, which records the moment of the sync into the CRM.", "defaultValue": null, "universalIdentifier": "b91e5608-871f-4f52-b3e0-a40afd96bc58"}, {"icon": "IconFileText", "name": "noteBody", "type": "TEXT", "label": "Note", "description": "Content of the note recorded during the service session.", "universalIdentifier": "c4599c9f-49b5-4438-adc4-8d5463f146ac"}, {"icon": "Icon123", "name": "id", "type": "UUID", "label": "Id", "isNullable": false, "description": "Id", "defaultValue": "uuid", "universalIdentifier": "e083d685-3fbf-53ed-b1aa-9733cc9fcb3e"}, {"icon": "IconCalendar", "name": "createdAt", "type": "DATE_TIME", "label": "Creation date", "isNullable": false, "description": "Creation date", "defaultValue": "now", "universalIdentifier": "5634823a-ea8c-5e86-85fb-db6a647a00cc"}, {"icon": "IconCalendarClock", "name": "updatedAt", "type": "DATE_TIME", "label": "Last update", "isNullable": false, "description": "Last time the record was changed", "defaultValue": "now", "universalIdentifier": "b22eb925-b0e5-5597-b2a2-26b361b43855"}, {"icon": "IconCalendarClock", "name": "deletedAt", "type": "DATE_TIME", "label": "Deleted at", "isNullable": true, "description": "Deletion date", "defaultValue": null, "universalIdentifier": "fbd26ff5-5b13-578c-9b58-e918ab63df89"}, {"icon": "IconCreativeCommonsSa", "name": "createdBy", "type": "ACTOR", "label": "Created by", "isNullable": false, "description": "The creator of the record", "defaultValue": {"name": "''", "source": "'MANUAL'"}, "universalIdentifier": "f77fdd09-b744-59b1-9d70-498364cbec97"}, {"icon": "IconUserCircle", "name": "updatedBy", "type": "ACTOR", "label": "Updated by", "isNullable": false, "description": "The workspace member who last updated the record", "defaultValue": {"name": "''", "source": "'MANUAL'"}, "universalIdentifier": "2f65dd89-34cd-55a1-9af3-b849e6e7d946"}, {"icon": "IconHierarchy2", "name": "position", "type": "POSITION", "label": "Position", "isNullable": false, "description": "Position", "defaultValue": 0, "universalIdentifier": "e4a9cc73-3920-5b50-95a7-8c49bbe6d358"}, {"icon": "IconSearch", "name": "searchVector", "type": "TS_VECTOR", "label": "Search vector", "isNullable": true, "description": "Search vector", "defaultValue": null, "universalIdentifier": "c70b803a-f8a1-57c2-8ca1-7ffd7046274b"}, {"icon": "IconBuildingSkyscraper", "name": "timelineActivities", "type": "RELATION", "label": "Timeline Activities", "isNullable": true, "description": "Conversation Notes tied to the SessionNote", "universalSettings": {"relationType": "ONE_TO_MANY"}, "universalIdentifier": "75472b9a-8571-566c-8717-bd9b04e7c263", "relationTargetFieldMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "048fd101-a0c0-519a-b8b8-7acb4c041be5", "relationTargetObjectMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "20202020-6736-4337-b5c4-8b39fae325a5"}, {"icon": "IconBuildingSkyscraper", "name": "attachments", "type": "RELATION", "label": "Attachments", "isNullable": true, "description": "Conversation Notes tied to the SessionNote", "universalSettings": {"relationType": "ONE_TO_MANY"}, "universalIdentifier": "3bb63f9a-bb0c-5db5-bf77-df7dd72ce61e", "relationTargetFieldMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "4c4fb6e5-0f2a-5ef1-85bf-483f6b35348d", "relationTargetObjectMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "20202020-bd3d-4c60-8dca-571c71d4447a"}, {"icon": "IconBuildingSkyscraper", "name": "noteTargets", "type": "RELATION", "label": "Note Targets", "isNullable": true, "description": "Conversation Notes tied to the SessionNote", "universalSettings": {"relationType": "ONE_TO_MANY"}, "universalIdentifier": "4c863445-0a4e-5847-8357-5b9ea9644662", "relationTargetFieldMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "1a4624ef-3117-5185-a075-3c3228519867", "relationTargetObjectMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "20202020-fff0-4b44-be82-bda313884400"}, {"icon": "IconBuildingSkyscraper", "name": "taskTargets", "type": "RELATION", "label": "Task Targets", "isNullable": true, "description": "Conversation Notes tied to the SessionNote", "universalSettings": {"relationType": "ONE_TO_MANY"}, "universalIdentifier": "d4065a3b-ee25-512b-8734-4582cbfa1cd0", "relationTargetFieldMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "52addaee-8075-5492-bc89-a8c2722ff61c", "relationTargetObjectMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "20202020-5a9a-44e8-95df-771cd06d0fb1"}], "namePlural": "sessionNotes", "description": "A note added during the Talqui service session, mirrored into the CRM. Always belongs to a Conversation.", "labelPlural": "Conversation Notes", "isSearchable": true, "nameSingular": "sessionNote", "labelSingular": "Conversation Note", "universalIdentifier": "66434c3c-6581-4777-9c6a-64fb0bbc3feb", "labelIdentifierFieldMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "e9188436-664f-4862-aced-4e747f3aee31"}, {"icon": "IconMessageCircle", "fields": [{"icon": "IconAbc", "name": "name", "type": "TEXT", "label": "Title", "description": "Session title. Filled by the events bridge (e.g. \\"Conversation with {contact} — {date}\\").", "universalIdentifier": "9eb6fdec-ea9a-4351-bd2d-01c38482095d"}, {"icon": "IconPlug", "name": "channel", "type": "SELECT", "label": "Channel", "options": [{"id": "fbded1c2-e797-4bbb-89b4-7fc4f3a3642e", "color": "green", "label": "WhatsApp", "value": "WHATSAPP", "position": 0}, {"id": "7be3b624-77ea-414f-bdad-24674c8370f5", "color": "pink", "label": "Instagram", "value": "INSTAGRAM", "position": 1}, {"id": "377ea49d-2420-47fd-befe-1653dc6f4e6f", "color": "yellow", "label": "Mercado Livre", "value": "MERCADOLIVRE", "position": 2}, {"id": "d1dd2f89-76b2-4e50-92cf-7c29cfa8494a", "color": "blue", "label": "Messenger", "value": "MESSENGER", "position": 3}, {"id": "4ed6aa08-4d7a-4adb-ba62-8ce85453f602", "color": "sky", "label": "Telegram", "value": "TELEGRAM", "position": 4}, {"id": "a6b72a68-bf11-4cb8-92ca-f77f2c230c86", "color": "purple", "label": "Webchat", "value": "WEBCHAT", "position": 5}, {"id": "c2ca6adb-190d-4905-84cf-b40936031de3", "color": "red", "label": "iFood", "value": "IFOOD", "position": 6}, {"id": "9f7be3c9-9920-4bdb-8a46-fed5bad9cbc7", "color": "gray", "label": "Email", "value": "EMAIL", "position": 7}, {"id": "f1e8aaf8-dca8-4ee3-8d7e-fbfa65d9c2f6", "color": "gray", "label": "Other", "value": "OTHER", "position": 8}], "description": "Channel family the session happened on in Talqui.", "defaultValue": "'OTHER'", "universalIdentifier": "e1e4fb47-53de-42c3-925c-e5b07dfb2f89"}, {"icon": "IconCalendarTime", "name": "startedAt", "type": "DATE_TIME", "label": "Started at", "isNullable": true, "description": "When the session started on Talqui (session.createdAt).", "defaultValue": null, "universalIdentifier": "8a33e25f-1dd8-490a-8ace-2fb44d861242"}, {"icon": "IconCalendarOff", "name": "endedAt", "type": "DATE_TIME", "label": "Ended at", "isNullable": true, "description": "When the session was closed on Talqui (session.closedAt).", "defaultValue": null, "universalIdentifier": "4f506405-2d82-465b-8837-6e4451bba7fa"}, {"icon": "IconClock", "name": "durationSec", "type": "NUMBER", "label": "Duration (s)", "isNullable": true, "description": "Session duration in seconds (endedAt - startedAt). Empty while the session is open.", "defaultValue": null, "universalIdentifier": "002aa75b-b157-4958-9e7f-cb306dfd15fd"}, {"icon": "IconExternalLink", "name": "url", "type": "LINKS", "label": "URL", "isNullable": true, "description": "Deep link to the session in the Talqui inbox.", "defaultValue": null, "universalIdentifier": "8a33b10d-5fa2-4089-8dc3-8c6a7af6b9fb"}, {"icon": "IconKey", "name": "externalId", "type": "TEXT", "label": "External ID", "description": "Talqui sessionID. Upsert key for the events bridge — do not edit manually.", "universalIdentifier": "d1e630df-82b5-4098-9f3c-220325d18b94"}, {"icon": "IconFileText", "name": "summary", "type": "TEXT", "label": "Summary", "description": "Session summary generated on Talqui (session.sessionSummary).", "universalIdentifier": "769554b2-6dd6-4150-91c5-2179a506ca11"}, {"icon": "IconStars", "name": "csatScore", "type": "RATING", "label": "CSAT score", "options": [{"id": "21f992c8-421a-4908-b025-d8d1fe464128", "label": "1", "value": "RATING_1", "position": 0}, {"id": "cfa68be9-cd9e-44b2-9b91-b41535d0f7e0", "label": "2", "value": "RATING_2", "position": 1}, {"id": "54eb2a42-8707-4f61-a0d7-7461568d0b72", "label": "3", "value": "RATING_3", "position": 2}, {"id": "82ac27b9-2c28-4492-bcb7-aca4f6f34cef", "label": "4", "value": "RATING_4", "position": 3}, {"id": "b25c26f2-2c80-4986-8a97-86107b1e9276", "label": "5", "value": "RATING_5", "position": 4}], "isNullable": true, "description": "Customer rating in stars (1-5). Empty when the contact did not rate — on Talqui, stars=0 means \\"not rated\\" and must never become 0 stars here.", "defaultValue": null, "universalIdentifier": "a887b5b7-755b-4dce-b620-0d3af6e553f6"}, {"icon": "IconFlag", "name": "serviceMotive", "type": "TEXT", "label": "Service motive", "description": "Service/close motive recorded on Talqui (session.closeMotive).", "universalIdentifier": "4193c755-ef60-425e-90ef-1c754e26c1d3"}, {"icon": "IconRoute", "name": "utmSource", "type": "TEXT", "label": "UTM Source", "isNullable": true, "description": "Traffic source of the conversation (CTWA: \\"instagram\\"). Set by the events bridge.", "universalIdentifier": "b52bd069-bf24-439d-a44a-89e30203961d"}, {"icon": "IconRoute", "name": "utmMedium", "type": "TEXT", "label": "UTM Medium", "isNullable": true, "description": "Traffic medium of the conversation (CTWA: \\"paid_social\\"). Set by the events bridge.", "universalIdentifier": "5726e06c-bd05-470f-b557-6b0164640e03"}, {"icon": "IconRoute", "name": "utmContent", "type": "TEXT", "label": "UTM Content", "isNullable": true, "description": "Creative/ad identifier of the conversation (CTWA: the Meta ad id). Set by the events bridge.", "universalIdentifier": "bd8cc3e5-8a21-4492-bfc4-67d0ec26d1be"}, {"icon": "IconRoute", "name": "utmCampaign", "type": "TEXT", "label": "UTM Campaign", "isNullable": true, "description": "Campaign of the conversation. For CTWA the ad->campaign lookup is deferred to the CAPI phase; empty for now.", "universalIdentifier": "cd05059c-f12e-497d-8104-f8b4073c91b3"}, {"icon": "IconBrandMeta", "name": "metaAdId", "type": "TEXT", "label": "Meta Ad ID", "isNullable": true, "description": "Meta ad the CTWA conversation came from (session.sessionMeta.referralSourceId). Set by the events bridge.", "universalIdentifier": "3098d356-7374-4f95-bb9b-3c715684a2b5"}, {"icon": "IconBrandWhatsapp", "name": "ctwaClid", "type": "TEXT", "label": "CTWA Click ID", "isNullable": true, "description": "Meta Click-to-WhatsApp click id (session.sessionMeta.referralCtwaClid) — key for Meta CAPI. Set by the events bridge.", "universalIdentifier": "1bab2e39-1166-449d-ba6f-99bc48edee29"}, {"icon": "IconTypography", "name": "talquiLeadId", "type": "TEXT", "label": "Talqui Lead ID", "isNullable": true, "description": "Talqui lead id (session.sessionMeta.tlID) — mirrors the opportunity key when the conversation carries one. Set by the events bridge.", "universalIdentifier": "e742d1d0-69ba-4303-8c62-994686c4cdf5"}, {"icon": "Icon123", "name": "id", "type": "UUID", "label": "Id", "isNullable": false, "description": "Id", "defaultValue": "uuid", "universalIdentifier": "bd30f6d3-ccea-5ffa-9ffe-f35560b5e340"}, {"icon": "IconCalendar", "name": "createdAt", "type": "DATE_TIME", "label": "Creation date", "isNullable": false, "description": "Creation date", "defaultValue": "now", "universalIdentifier": "cf9b3cdd-1f80-5b63-a67b-15dca394a1f5"}, {"icon": "IconCalendarClock", "name": "updatedAt", "type": "DATE_TIME", "label": "Last update", "isNullable": false, "description": "Last time the record was changed", "defaultValue": "now", "universalIdentifier": "e46dc69a-31a1-5dce-b500-8a52193294f8"}, {"icon": "IconCalendarClock", "name": "deletedAt", "type": "DATE_TIME", "label": "Deleted at", "isNullable": true, "description": "Deletion date", "defaultValue": null, "universalIdentifier": "4e2a8e8f-eacc-5aaf-ab86-dc96f1468b45"}, {"icon": "IconCreativeCommonsSa", "name": "createdBy", "type": "ACTOR", "label": "Created by", "isNullable": false, "description": "The creator of the record", "defaultValue": {"name": "''", "source": "'MANUAL'"}, "universalIdentifier": "4e182fb8-22b3-5902-a5c6-58b95eb8d7e8"}, {"icon": "IconUserCircle", "name": "updatedBy", "type": "ACTOR", "label": "Updated by", "isNullable": false, "description": "The workspace member who last updated the record", "defaultValue": {"name": "''", "source": "'MANUAL'"}, "universalIdentifier": "aa1b5115-8fb8-5fe7-af6a-507ddf43e5a8"}, {"icon": "IconHierarchy2", "name": "position", "type": "POSITION", "label": "Position", "isNullable": false, "description": "Position", "defaultValue": 0, "universalIdentifier": "bd2c7f16-22c6-58d5-9c62-5ae1cf4d1c71"}, {"icon": "IconSearch", "name": "searchVector", "type": "TS_VECTOR", "label": "Search vector", "isNullable": true, "description": "Search vector", "defaultValue": null, "universalIdentifier": "0a0c5efb-53cb-502a-a04e-30b533893fad"}, {"icon": "IconBuildingSkyscraper", "name": "timelineActivities", "type": "RELATION", "label": "Timeline Activities", "isNullable": true, "description": "Conversations tied to the Session", "universalSettings": {"relationType": "ONE_TO_MANY"}, "universalIdentifier": "f9a42bad-2126-5b59-bc49-ac94c046a507", "relationTargetFieldMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "ee4fdd74-7146-53da-b94e-cdb7f41e52f5", "relationTargetObjectMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "20202020-6736-4337-b5c4-8b39fae325a5"}, {"icon": "IconBuildingSkyscraper", "name": "attachments", "type": "RELATION", "label": "Attachments", "isNullable": true, "description": "Conversations tied to the Session", "universalSettings": {"relationType": "ONE_TO_MANY"}, "universalIdentifier": "1cdc8fba-22b6-5525-bd6b-b35a30382123", "relationTargetFieldMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "9f0b7a69-3f8d-5fd2-80e9-d245fca89593", "relationTargetObjectMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "20202020-bd3d-4c60-8dca-571c71d4447a"}, {"icon": "IconBuildingSkyscraper", "name": "noteTargets", "type": "RELATION", "label": "Note Targets", "isNullable": true, "description": "Conversations tied to the Session", "universalSettings": {"relationType": "ONE_TO_MANY"}, "universalIdentifier": "40383ba1-ba37-500b-a95b-fa9a29e83445", "relationTargetFieldMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "4a620d2e-0099-5034-9c50-251e10e30632", "relationTargetObjectMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "20202020-fff0-4b44-be82-bda313884400"}, {"icon": "IconBuildingSkyscraper", "name": "taskTargets", "type": "RELATION", "label": "Task Targets", "isNullable": true, "description": "Conversations tied to the Session", "universalSettings": {"relationType": "ONE_TO_MANY"}, "universalIdentifier": "20cb07ef-7663-5c52-aff6-29be48571659", "relationTargetFieldMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "40b85bd2-f3c4-5790-af66-31913c5a76c8", "relationTargetObjectMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "20202020-5a9a-44e8-95df-771cd06d0fb1"}], "namePlural": "sessions", "description": "A Talqui customer-service session mirrored into the CRM. Points to the original session on the Talqui platform.", "labelPlural": "Conversations", "isSearchable": true, "nameSingular": "session", "labelSingular": "Conversation", "universalIdentifier": "ce892978-2336-4d31-a146-85872d516fce", "labelIdentifierFieldMetadataUniversalIdentifier": "9eb6fdec-ea9a-4351-bd2d-01c38482095d"}], "viewFields": [], "application": {"author": "Talqui Chat", "logoUrl": "public/logo.svg", "category": "Communication", "websiteUrl": "https://talqui.chat/en/", "description": "AI-powered chat for Webchat, WhatsApp and Instagram integrated to your CRM", "displayName": "Talqui Chat", "screenshots": ["public/interface-01.jpg", "public/interface-02.jpg", "public/integrations-01.jpg"], "emailSupport": "support@talqui.com", "issueReportUrl": "mailto:support@talqui.com", "aboutDescription": "<div align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img src=\\"https://cdn.talqui.chat/static/plugins/urn%3Atalqui%3Acrms%3A0/twenty-extension/logo.svg\\" width=\\"112\\" height=\\"112\\" alt=\\"Talqui logo\\" />\\n\\n  <h1>Talqui for Twenty</h1>\\n\\n  <p>\\n    <strong>Every customer and sales conversation — WhatsApp, Instagram, Webchat, Telegram, and Messenger — live inside your Twenty CRM.</strong><br/>\\n    Contacts created for you, conversations summarized by AI, and an AI agent that can reply on your behalf — all synced automatically.\\n  </p>\\n\\n  <p>\\n    <img src=\\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Twenty-%E2%89%A5%202.8-6c47ff?style=flat-square\\" alt=\\"Twenty >= 2.8\\" />\\n    <img src=\\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Channels-WhatsApp%20·%20Instagram%20·%20Webchat%20·%20Telegram%20·%20Messenger-1d9bf0?style=flat-square\\" alt=\\"Channels\\" />\\n    <img src=\\"https://img.shields.io/badge/AI-powered-0aa06e?style=flat-square\\" alt=\\"AI-powered\\" />\\n    <img src=\\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-3a3a3a?style=flat-square\\" alt=\\"MIT license\\" />\\n    <a href=\\"https://talqui.chat/en/\\"><img src=\\"https://img.shields.io/badge/talqui.chat-↗-000000?style=flat-square\\" alt=\\"Website\\" /></a>\\n  </p>\\n</div>\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Talqui** unifies your company's messaging channels into a single inbox — and, with this app, into your **Twenty** CRM. Every real conversation your team has with a customer becomes structured CRM data: the contact, the company, the opportunity, and the full story of what was said.\\n\\nNo exports. No spreadsheets. No copy‑pasting screenshots into notes. Your conversations simply *show up* where your team already works — and, if you want, an AI agent keeps them moving even when nobody is online.\\n\\n## ✨ Why teams install it\\n\\n- **Omnichannel, meet your CRM** — WhatsApp, Instagram, Webchat, Telegram, and Messenger all land in Twenty as first‑class records, in real time.\\n- **Contacts on autopilot** — the moment a new number or handle reaches out, the Person is created in Twenty and linked to the right Company and Opportunity. Nobody is ever *\\"not in the CRM\\"* again.\\n- **AI that answers for you** — turn on Talqui's AI to reply across your connected channels, day or night, in your tone — and every one of those AI conversations is logged in Twenty just like a human one.\\n- **AI summaries, not transcripts** — every conversation arrives with an AI‑written summary, the reason behind the contact, and a satisfaction score. The story in seconds, the full thread one click away.\\n- **A history your reps actually read** — a dedicated **Conversations** tab on every Person, Company, and Opportunity, so the last talk, the channel, and the sentiment are always at hand.\\n- **Zero upkeep** — tickets, service calls, and sales chats are recorded automatically, the instant they happen.\\n\\n## 🤖 Let AI handle the conversation\\n\\nTalqui isn't just a pipe into your CRM — it can **talk for you**. Enable an AI agent on any connected channel and it will:\\n\\n- **Reply automatically** across WhatsApp, Instagram, Webchat, Telegram, and Messenger, in your brand's voice.\\n- **Qualify and route** — answer common questions, capture intent, and hand off to a human the moment it matters.\\n- **Never break the record** — everything the AI says and hears is captured in Twenty: the contact, the conversation, the summary, and the outcome stay perfectly in sync.\\n\\nYour team scales its coverage without losing a single data point — the plugin makes sure the CRM always reflects reality.\\n\\n## 💬 What lands in Twenty\\n\\nEach conversation becomes a **Conversation** record, fully linked to the right Person, Company, and Opportunity:\\n\\n| Field | What it tells you |\\n| --- | --- |\\n| **Channel** | WhatsApp, Instagram, Webchat, Telegram, or Messenger |\\n| **Started / Ended / Duration** | When it happened and how long it took |\\n| **AI summary** | The conversation, distilled |\\n| **Motive** | Why the customer reached out |\\n| **CSAT score** | How the interaction felt to the customer |\\n| **Direct link** | One click back to the live thread in Talqui |\\n| **Conversation notes** | Follow‑up notes tied to the exact talk |\\n\\n## 🤝 Contacts & pipeline, created for you\\n\\n- **Auto‑created contacts** — a first message is enough to spin up the Person in Twenty. No untracked leads.\\n- **Smart association** — new conversations attach to the existing contact instead of cluttering your base with duplicates.\\n- **Opportunities in sync** — deals are created and updated automatically from the lead behind each conversation, so your pipeline mirrors what's actually being said.\\n\\n## 📊 Built for sales and support\\n\\n- **Sales** — walk into every call knowing the entire conversation history with that contact: what they asked, what was promised, how they felt.\\n- **Support** — every service ticket and call is logged against the customer, so the next agent picks up exactly where the last one left off.\\n- **Leadership** — channels, motives, and CSAT on your records turn scattered chats into reporting you can trust.\\n\\n## 🌐 Channels\\n\\nConnect the channels your customers already use — every message from any of them flows into the same place in Twenty:\\n\\n- **WhatsApp** — the number your customers text every day.\\n- **Instagram** — DMs from your profile, straight into the CRM.\\n- **Webchat** — the little chat bubble you install on your website, so visitors can talk to you (or your AI) without leaving the page.\\n- **Telegram** — conversations from your Telegram bot or channel.\\n- **Messenger** — Facebook Messenger threads from your page.\\n\\n> More channels are added to Talqui over time — as you connect them, they show up in Twenty automatically, no extra setup on the CRM side.\\n\\n## 🚀 Get started\\n\\n1. **Install** — in Twenty, open **Settings → Marketplace**, search for **Talqui**, and click **Install**.\\n2. **Connect** — link your Talqui workspace and pick the channels you want to sync (and, optionally, turn on the AI agent).\\n3. **Done** — your existing history is backfilled and every new conversation flows into Twenty in real time.\\n\\n> Requires an active [Talqui](https://talqui.chat/en/) account with at least one connected channel, and a Twenty server on **v2.8 or newer**.\\n\\n## 💬 Support\\n\\n- 🌐 Website — [talqui.chat](https://talqui.chat/en/)\\n- ✉️ Support — [support@talqui.com](mailto:support@talqui.com)\\n- 🐞 Report an issue — [support@talqui.com](mailto:support@talqui.com)\\n\\n## 🖼️ See it in action\\n\\n<div align=\\"center\\">\\n  <img src=\\"https://cdn.talqui.chat/static/plugins/urn%3Atalqui%3Acrms%3A0/twenty-extension/interface-01.jpg\\" alt=\\"Talqui unified inbox — every channel in one screen\\" width=\\"100%\\" />\\n  <br/><br/>\\n  <em>One inbox for WhatsApp, Instagram, Webchat, Telegram, and Messenger — the conversations that feed your CRM.</em>\\n  <br/><br/>\\n  <img src=\\"https://cdn.talqui.chat/static/plugins/urn%3Atalqui%3Acrms%3A0/twenty-extension/integrations-01.jpg\\" alt=\\"Talqui connects your channels to the Twenty contact record\\" width=\\"100%\\" />\\n  <br/><br/>\\n  <em>Channels connected to the contact record — conversations, summaries, and history in context.</em>\\n  <br/><br/>\\n  <img src=\\"https://cdn.talqui.chat/static/plugins/urn%3Atalqui%3Acrms%3A0/twenty-extension/interface-02.jpg\\" alt=\\"Talqui running in the browser\\" width=\\"100%\\" />\\n</div>\\n\\n---\\n\\n<div align=\\"center\\">\\n  <sub>Built with 💙 by <a href=\\"https://talqui.chat/en/\\">Talqui</a> · Released under the MIT License</sub>\\n</div>\\n", "yarnLockChecksum": "037532a9090105ac6d744ab3b28dadc8", "packageJsonChecksum": "ce38ca6d71543d6668e18c181adc82ae", "universalIdentifier": "7880eb3d-e2cd-4396-a9ed-159b1eecb2fd", "defaultRoleUniversalIdentifier": "ca41b3b3-bd0d-