enty opportunities with your signing workflow. Start a\ndocument from a sajn template, prefill it with the opportunity and point of\ncontact, and send it for signing without copying customer details between\nsystems.\n\n## What you can do\n\n- Create a draft or send a document from an Opportunity.\n- Use the Opportunity name, value, and point-of-contact details automatically.\n- See every related sajn document inside Twenty.\n- Follow signing progress from draft to completion.\n- Open the document in sajn whenever you need to review or edit it.\n\n## Get started\n\nOnce your workspace administrator has connected sajn, open an Opportunity and\nchoose **Create sajn document** from the command menu.\n\nNeed help? Contact [hej@sajn.se](mailto:hej@sajn.se).\n	https://www.sajn.se/allmanna-villkor	hej@sajn.se	\N	{}	[{"path": "public/cover.generated.png", "fileId": "d99fc556-ad00-4a69-94fa-310bf9586a92"}]	a2d1f4ee-27e5-423b-99a7-583594740dfc	\N
