nnected account.", "handlerName": "default.config.handler", "timeoutSeconds": 15, "builtHandlerPath": "src/logic-functions/fathom-backfill.mjs", "sourceHandlerPath": "src/logic-functions/fathom-backfill.ts", "universalIdentifier": "b4ee8f0c-59e8-4586-8e5a-b2aca5624cbe", "builtHandlerChecksum": "85e27c1f23e2da1d8058a717fd607e54", "httpRouteTriggerSettings": {"path": "/fathom/backfill", "httpMethod": "POST", "isAuthRequired": true}}, {"name": "fathom-register-connection", "description": "Registers a Fathom webhook using the connected account's permissions and starts the initial history import.", "handlerName": "default.config.handler", "timeoutSeconds": 30, "builtHandlerPath": "src/logic-functions/fathom-register-connection.mjs", "sourceHandlerPath": "src/logic-functions/fathom-register-connection.ts", "universalIdentifier": "d6cb329f-8d0d-48f0-af30-e3ce2e11ddc6", "builtHandlerChecksum": "ba82534db3cf2a2e5ee02bbb61513d74"}, {"name": "fathom-backfill-batch", "description": "Fetches the transcript and summary of one paced batch of Fathom meetings and upserts their CallRecordings.", "handlerName": "default.config.handler", "timeoutSeconds": 300, "builtHandlerPath": "src/logic-functions/fathom-backfill-batch.mjs", "sourceHandlerPath": "src/logic-functions/fathom-backfill-batch.ts", "universalIdentifier": "f94eacc8-c611-4453-a865-e4650953ccec", "builtHandlerChecksum": "42c109f122a38d883aa898593cdd18c1"}], "pageLayoutTabs": [], "frontComponents": [], "permissionFlags": [], "commandMenuItems": [], "connectionProviders": [{"name": "fathom", "type": "oauth", "oauth": {"scopes": ["public_api"], "usePkce": false, "tokenEndpoint": "https://api.fathom.ai/external/v1/oauth2/token", "clientIdVariable": "FATHOM_CLIENT_ID", "clientSecretVariable": "FATHOM_CLIENT_SECRET", "authorizationEndpoint": "https://fathom.video/external/v1/oauth2/authorize", "tokenRequestContentType": "form-urlencoded"}, "displayName": "Fathom", "universalIdentifier": "eec1a27d-7678-43df-81e9-9f245ada8fe4", "onConnectLogicFunction": {"universalIdentifier": "d6cb329f-8d0d-48f0-af30-e3ce2e11ddc6"}, "onDisconnectLogicFunction": {"universalIdentifier": "51edabd6-6698-4317-b134-f1d41633d76b"}}], "navigationMenuItems": [], "timelineActivityTypes": []}	f	f	public/logo.svg	Sync each connected user's Fathom recordings, transcripts, summaries, action items, and meeting metadata into Twenty.	Twenty	Productivity	https://www.fathom.ai	# Fathom\n\n**Every Fathom recording, transcript, and summary, right inside your CRM.**\n\n## ✨ What you get\n\n- **Fathom transcripts, summaries, and action items saved when available**\n- **Recording video, or audio for audio-only calls, on the same record**\n- **Saved to a Call Recording, with calendar links for clear matches**\n- **New meetings synced as they happen**\n- **Your last 31 days imported the moment you connect**\n- **Built for AI & automation**\n\n## 💳 Billing\n\n**Free to run**: no per-seat, per-recording or per-import charge. AI actions use\nAI credits based on the model's token usage.\n\n## 📌 Heads up\n\n- **Everything you import is shared with your workspace.** Transcripts,\n  summaries, and media land on Call Recording records that every member with\n  access can read. Private syncing is coming later.\n- **Media arrives after the transcript, and not always.** A recording stays in\n  Processing while Fathom prepares the download. Anything over 500 MB, and\n  view-only shares, never get media.\n- **Calendar links need one clear match.** A Call Recording is linked to a\n  calendar event only when its meeting link and scheduled time point to exactly\n  one event.\n	https://www.twenty.com/terms	contact@twenty.com	https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/issues	{}	[{"path": "public/gallery/fathom-cover-image-1.png", "fileId": "9838d179-3bef-4a6b-8446-c82ff942c0a3"}, {"path": "public/gallery/fathom-cover-image-2.png", "fileId": "f2c2c69b-29e8-4408-bf68-8a659b8ba273"}]	0b48520d-be07-4c8b-a4ef-c6098b850d82	\N
