nt": false, "builtComponentPath": "src/components/create-issue-form.front-component.mjs", "sourceComponentPath": "src/components/create-issue-form.front-component.tsx", "universalIdentifier": "d4a1c8e5-7f3b-4d62-a90e-1b5c3f8d2a6e", "builtComponentChecksum": "e5bfab627507c0a68b86c7f9d5c27c36"}], "commandMenuItems": [{"icon": "IconPlaylistAdd", "label": "Create Linear issue", "isPinned": false, "shortLabel": "Linear issue", "availabilityType": "GLOBAL", "universalIdentifier": "e7b3d9f2-6a1c-4e85-b4d0-8f2c5a7e3b19", "frontComponentUniversalIdentifier": "d4a1c8e5-7f3b-4d62-a90e-1b5c3f8d2a6e"}], "connectionProviders": [{"name": "linear", "type": "oauth", "oauth": {"scopes": ["read", "write"], "usePkce": true, "tokenEndpoint": "https://api.linear.app/oauth/token", "revokeEndpoint": "https://api.linear.app/oauth/revoke", "clientIdVariable": "LINEAR_CLIENT_ID", "clientSecretVariable": "LINEAR_CLIENT_SECRET", "authorizationEndpoint": "https://linear.app/oauth/authorize", "tokenRequestContentType": "form-urlencoded"}, "displayName": "Linear", "universalIdentifier": "9c7d1f5e-6a0b-4d44-be0c-3f8b5a9d4e6f"}], "navigationMenuItems": []}	f	f	public/linear-logomark.svg	Connect Linear to Twenty. Each workspace member connects their own Linear account; logic functions can then create issues and read team data on their behalf.	Twenty	Product management	https://www.twenty.com	Connect your Linear account to Twenty to create issues and look up teams straight from your workflows or the AI chat.\n\n## What you can do\n\nOnce installed and connected, two tools become available:\n\n- **Create Linear issue**\n  - From the AI chat, ask something like *"create a Linear issue in the Engineering team titled 'Fix login bug'"* and the AI will file it for you.\n  - From a workflow, add it as a step with `teamId` + `title` (and optional `description`).\n\n- **List Linear teams** — discovers the teams in your Linear workspace, useful when you need to pick a `teamId` for the create-issue step.\n\n## Installing\n\n1. Open **Settings → Applications** in your Twenty workspace.\n2. Find **Linear** in the available apps and click **Install**.\n3. Open the app, go to the **Connections** tab, and click **Add connection**.\n4. Choose **Just for me** (your personal Linear account) or **Workspace shared** (a team-managed Linear account anyone in this workspace can act through), then complete the Linear sign-in.\n\nThat's it — you can now use the tools above.	https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty?tab=License-1-ov-file#readme	contact@twenty.com	\N	{}	[{"path": "public/gallery/command-menu-item-1.png", "fileId": "1807a9cb-e415-4678-9f0d-3ca08f9bf1d1"}, {"path": "public/gallery/command-menu-item-2.png", "fileId": "03697af1-1afa-4c40-9579-e4e68bf3bcd4"}, {"path": "public/gallery/command-menu-item-3.png", "fileId": "09aae89a-2cc7-49a7-b398-2d44c5a76714"}, {"path": "public/gallery/command-menu-item-4.png", "fileId": "abba4124-4e1b-4e20-ba39-9edff1472a43"}]	cd0836c4-1ca7-46f4-9cb2-a89920900cbb	\N
